    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.clipboard, mini.scrollbar, mini.garbage\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nHi echasnovski! Do you think plugins like https://github.com/AckslD/nvim-neoclip.lua, https://github.com/Zeioth/garbage-day.nvim and https://github.com/petertriho/nvim-scrollbar equivalent be added as part of the mini.nvim suite.",
